{
  "asserts": "both sides seal halves of one deal, each citing the other half and the other side's checkpoint; each pushes its half at completion with share_record_at_completion on; the receiver holds the foreign bytes by digest and seals a record citing them; acceptance is keyed on the evidence key under a controller declaration",
  "detail": "node stevenmih-1: 15 held halves, each held by its digest (Class 1 and the capsule_id recomputed by the AAC Go verifier), under the checkpoint it was pushed with (evidencebook), and cited as counterparty_half by the node's own record, which says it accepted the half's key via host_announced; node stevenmih-2: 9 held halves, each held by its digest (Class 1 and the capsule_id recomputed by the AAC Go verifier), under the checkpoint it was pushed with (evidencebook), and cited as counterparty_half by the node's own record, which says it accepted the half's key via host_announced; node stevenmih-3: 13 held halves, each held by its digest (Class 1 and the capsule_id recomputed by the AAC Go verifier), under the checkpoint it was pushed with (evidencebook), and cited as counterparty_half by the node's own record, which says it accepted the half's key via host_announced; exchanges with a half held on each of two nodes (joined on client_nonce): 16 (nonce 3bf4d449-d9b7-4495-ab80-b551062269f6 is not one exchange held on two nodes: stevenmih-2 requested; nonce 6e2f156e-6246-4614-9cc9-3a0c8f750ac6 is not one exchange held on two nodes: stevenmih-1 requested; nonce 879aa6f2-77d5-4a17-b89d-7ea5dd1383b5 is not one exchange held on two nodes: stevenmih-3 served; nonce e564a97e-e5de-472f-a59e-c4cae860f725 is not one exchange held on two nodes: stevenmih-3 served; nonce f8dfc0a0-dc3c-4e09-8a0a-c4b217395388 is not one exchange held on two nodes: stevenmih-1 requested). Spend: none; this step starts no exchange and pays nothing (would spend 0 USD).",
