      "issue": "Mesh-LLM/capsules-plugin#136",
      "what": "each side pushing its half at completion by default",
      "why": "the pinned plugin defaults share_record_at_completion to counterparty (capsules-plugin PR #72, in the pin), but a node's setting is not in its data dir to read"
